<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>New Lead Captured</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px;">
        <h1 style="color: #333;">🚀 New Lead Captured!</h1>
        <p>A new lead was just submitted through your widget: <strong>{{ widgetName }}</strong>.</p>
        <h3 style="border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;">Lead Data:</h3>
        <pre style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;">{{ leadData }}</pre>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">This is an automated notification from PopupAlerts.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>